Z||000007||Bazooka||06-26-2001||08:58 PM||||<BR>Hey Crash,<BR>    THAT .003 HAS GOT TO BE THE QUICKEST. My best Reaction Times have been .071 AND .080, both at Great Lakes Dragaway in my V8 Fiero also without Linelock or Computer. Of course, you are walking a thin line if you can do .003 twice in one day without Redliting. The tough competitors usually wind up with .500 times in the heats. Haaave you heard about the Raffle for the Built Up 66 Chevy II Hot Rod Giveaway Car from the 'Power Tour'? Very Sweet Machine! It will be announced this September who the winner is.<BR>************************************<BR> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Fierowrecker:<BR><B>Hey Bazooka!<BR>I drag raced at Martin 131 dragway in Michigan and have time slips showing .003 sec. reaction times...<BR>This was in a 63 Chevy II Nova with no computer or line lock...<BR>crash...</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>||||reg||1
